WEBVTT

00:05.372 --> 00:07.932
Gale Force Wind!

00:09.242 --> 00:10.209
Another one!

00:10.343 --> 00:12.208
Block!

00:13.847 --> 00:15.041
Wh-What?!

00:33.299 --> 00:34.732
R-Rumina!

00:45.578 --> 00:46.510
Rumina...

00:48.782 --> 00:51.751
You don't have time to be looking
elsewhere, Chelsea Rorec!

00:56.122 --> 00:58.022
Claws of Ice!
Claws of Ice!

01:03.897 --> 01:04.795
She did it again!

01:04.864 --> 01:07.526
I thought I cleared her hit,
but her arm extended!

01:07.934 --> 01:08.923
What?

01:09.002 --> 01:11.436
You look like an animal
cornered by a fox.

01:13.273 --> 01:15.207
You can't escape from me.

01:15.742 --> 01:18.302
Not from my Mirage of Ice!

01:18.545 --> 01:19.409
Mirage of Ice?!

01:46.673 --> 01:50.268
The city at night is so cold

01:50.343 --> 01:54.040
I feel like I'm going to lose my mind

01:54.114 --> 01:57.481
I wonder if I can keep going

01:57.550 --> 02:00.178
The important thing...

02:00.253 --> 02:02.517
You must tell me

02:02.589 --> 02:04.113
Please

02:04.324 --> 02:09.318
Do people meet only so
they can part one day?

02:09.395 --> 02:13.832
Tell me that's not true

02:14.667 --> 02:18.501
I loved you so much that it hurt

02:18.571 --> 02:21.972
Everything was sparkling all around

02:22.041 --> 02:25.374
There was nothing to be afraid of

02:25.445 --> 02:29.279
I believed in that

02:29.349 --> 02:32.978
That moment when
my passions stirred

02:33.052 --> 02:36.544
To the point where I thought
I would fall apart

02:36.623 --> 02:40.024
I will never forget that moment

02:40.093 --> 02:43.392
I will never say I want to go back

02:43.463 --> 02:49.561
I just want to see you one more time

03:03.516 --> 03:06.452
Fight to the Death -
Beyond the Hatred
Fight to the Death -
Beyond the Hatred.

03:06.452 --> 03:10.149
Fight to the Death -
Beyond the Hatred

03:27.740 --> 03:28.832
Excuse me, sir.

03:35.281 --> 03:37.545
Tremors of unknown cause
were detected...

03:37.617 --> 03:40.245
...in the region
of the underground cave.

03:41.688 --> 03:43.656
Tremors in the underground cave?

03:43.723 --> 03:46.624
I think it might be
the result of Teil...

03:46.693 --> 03:48.752
...coming into contact
with the intruders.

03:48.828 --> 03:51.592
That is Pairon's responsibility.

03:52.298 --> 03:54.596
There's no need to
inform me about it.

03:54.667 --> 03:59.866
But, it seems there is another
warrior fighting alongside Teil.

04:02.442 --> 04:04.808
That would make it
our responsibility.

04:04.877 --> 04:06.811
Send an investigation team.

04:06.879 --> 04:08.506
Bring back that idiot.

04:08.681 --> 04:09.272
Yes, sir.

04:12.885 --> 04:16.082
It looks like you want to
go as well, Seki.

04:16.823 --> 04:17.653
Of course.

04:18.358 --> 04:20.758
I have to pay back that wind user.

04:21.027 --> 04:23.291
Lord Kashin
will be coming today.

04:23.796 --> 04:26.321
You'll have to be here for that.

04:27.800 --> 04:28.892
I know that.

04:33.606 --> 04:34.800
Hey, Raunchy.

04:34.974 --> 04:36.407
It's not "Raunchy".

04:36.476 --> 04:37.465
It's Raichi!

04:37.844 --> 04:39.744
When are you going
to remember?

04:39.979 --> 04:42.004
Who really cares?

04:42.115 --> 04:44.174
Anyway, what's going on?

04:44.250 --> 04:45.808
Seems pretty busy around here.

04:46.019 --> 04:47.452
I heard that Teil and some warrior...

04:47.520 --> 04:50.751
...are having it out with
the intruders from the surface.

04:50.823 --> 04:52.882
Intruders from the surface?

04:53.092 --> 04:53.854
What?!

04:55.728 --> 04:58.629
Chelsea and Rumina are coming?!

05:01.100 --> 05:02.089
Ruri...

05:06.005 --> 05:08.269
He's now able to launch
the Gale Force Wind repeatedly.

05:08.808 --> 05:09.604
Where is he?!

05:11.544 --> 05:12.374
From above?!

05:23.089 --> 05:24.317
How could he?!

05:24.390 --> 05:27.826
Did he launch Gale Force Wind
and use its recoil?!

05:28.594 --> 05:30.323
No, I didn't sense that.

05:30.396 --> 05:31.420
Then, how...?

05:42.475 --> 05:43.533
The winds...

05:43.976 --> 05:45.341
The winds gather...

05:46.679 --> 05:49.978
Has his power gotten stronger?

05:55.621 --> 05:56.883
I understand now.

05:59.158 --> 06:03.219
Blindly swinging your
sword around won't do.

06:03.896 --> 06:06.763
You must manipulate the wind.

06:06.833 --> 06:09.859
For that, you have to
understand the wind.

06:10.069 --> 06:11.093
Understand the wind.

06:11.838 --> 06:12.668
That's right.

06:13.439 --> 06:17.136
Let it brush up against your body.
Feel the wind.

06:17.377 --> 06:20.073
How am I supposed to
understand all that?!

06:20.146 --> 06:22.239
You can't even understand that?!

06:22.415 --> 06:23.882
Maybe it's easy for you...

06:23.950 --> 06:26.009
...but I have no idea
what you're talking about?

06:32.492 --> 06:33.220
He was right.

06:33.726 --> 06:35.421
It's just as Gramps said.

06:35.561 --> 06:37.722
It was actually something
very easy.

06:40.032 --> 06:43.001
Because I'd already seen it before.

06:47.507 --> 06:52.501
The sight of a girl with the
wind brushing against her body.

06:56.949 --> 06:58.917
The wind bends to my will!

07:03.022 --> 07:04.546
Ride the wind!

07:05.491 --> 07:06.549
Dodge!

07:08.795 --> 07:09.386
How come?!

07:09.462 --> 07:11.259
100 tons of pressured water
has no effect!

07:13.399 --> 07:14.696
There's no way!

07:15.468 --> 07:17.333
I'm a warrior of the highest rank!

07:17.403 --> 07:20.861
I have greater mastery of
my power than anyone!

07:21.374 --> 07:24.275
There's no reason
why I should lose to you!

07:24.811 --> 07:26.938
But you will lose!

07:29.048 --> 07:30.447
Don't you get carried away!

07:31.584 --> 07:32.744
Wave Ring!

07:42.195 --> 07:43.127
You!

07:46.933 --> 07:50.391
There is no way
you can escape now.

07:50.670 --> 07:51.568
And...

07:54.907 --> 07:56.875
This will cut you to pieces.

07:56.943 --> 07:59.810
The hunter of lives
and the prison of water.

07:59.879 --> 08:01.244
Tidal Knives!

08:04.383 --> 08:07.409
Hey! Hey! Hey!
Why don't you just give it up?!

08:07.820 --> 08:10.050
You can't escape
from the Mirage of Ice!

08:18.231 --> 08:19.391
Take that!

08:22.068 --> 08:24.059
I keep telling you that
you can't touch me.

08:24.337 --> 08:25.031
Why?

08:35.882 --> 08:37.543
You look pathetic, Rorec!

08:37.817 --> 08:40.513
Wh-Why is this so slippery?!

08:40.987 --> 08:42.852
Not only that, but I'm freezing!

08:47.393 --> 08:48.360
Frost...

08:48.794 --> 08:50.659
Why is there frost here?

08:51.931 --> 08:53.193
That means...!

08:56.736 --> 08:57.828
Wh-What?

08:58.938 --> 08:59.700
What's the matter?

09:01.240 --> 09:02.366
I understand now.

09:03.042 --> 09:05.169
How the Mirage of Ice works.

09:06.412 --> 09:09.540
It would be unnatural
for there to be frost here.

09:09.615 --> 09:10.673
And so...

09:10.750 --> 09:14.618
...you must have been
responsible for spraying it here.

09:15.021 --> 09:15.646
That's right.

09:15.922 --> 09:17.583
As you dealt out your Nails of Ice...

09:17.657 --> 09:20.558
...you also sprayed the area
with small particles of frost.

09:20.693 --> 09:24.527
The frost in the air reflected
the light, causing an illusion...

09:24.597 --> 09:27.259
...that resulted in a slight
difference in depth perception.

09:28.100 --> 09:30.534
And that's why it looked like
your arm extended!

09:31.771 --> 09:33.636
I'll prove it to you right now!

09:37.176 --> 09:39.838
This is the ice that you sprayed!

09:40.780 --> 09:41.906
Clever deduction!

09:42.148 --> 09:43.706
But you're already a goner!

09:44.283 --> 09:46.376
I can win without
the Mirage of Ice!

09:49.889 --> 09:51.356
Nails of Ice!

09:55.595 --> 09:56.254
What?!

09:56.529 --> 09:58.156
She sent a gravity wave upward?!

10:01.233 --> 10:05.602
To think she can still use
such an immense power.

10:05.838 --> 10:06.361
But...

10:07.306 --> 10:08.967
I'm not done yet!

10:20.653 --> 10:21.347
A mirror?

10:21.787 --> 10:22.515
Bingo!

10:28.861 --> 10:29.725
Right.

10:29.895 --> 10:32.955
She turned the ice she gathered
with her gravity into a mirror.

10:36.469 --> 10:37.993
Serves you right!

10:39.372 --> 10:42.603
My wounds finally heal, and now
I'm wounded all over again.

10:42.675 --> 10:44.734
How will I ever find a husband like this...

10:44.810 --> 10:46.300
Uh, what am I saying...?

10:49.682 --> 10:50.842
How do you like that?!

10:52.885 --> 10:54.250
H-How could that be?!

10:55.054 --> 10:58.455
The Tidal Knives
rain daggers of water...

10:58.524 --> 11:00.458
...at a speed that no one
is able to see.

11:00.526 --> 11:04.018
It should be impossible to block it
with a wall of wind.

11:04.964 --> 11:09.424
How could he have deflected
all of the water daggers?

11:10.803 --> 11:13.135
You can't predict the trajectory
of the water daggers.

11:13.205 --> 11:15.070
The only way he might be able to...

11:15.508 --> 11:17.408
Could it be that...

11:17.610 --> 11:19.202
He read the wind?!

11:22.882 --> 11:27.649
He must've sensed the changes in
the airflow caused by the daggers.

11:32.958 --> 11:34.755
Is that how he avoided my attack?!

11:36.662 --> 11:38.630
If that were the case...

11:38.698 --> 11:42.361
...he's a match for any warrior,
or anyone in the Company.

11:42.802 --> 11:44.633
Now it's my turn!

11:45.938 --> 11:48.236
Asagi Swordsmanship!

11:49.108 --> 11:50.097
Gale Force Wind!

11:56.482 --> 11:58.882
How can I... be losing...?

12:00.820 --> 12:01.787
Rat-tail!

12:21.574 --> 12:23.405
You're giving up.

12:23.609 --> 12:25.509
Is that what you want to say?

12:28.314 --> 12:32.307
It's that kind of thinking
that'll get you killed!

12:36.255 --> 12:38.553
How many times do you want to lose?!

12:42.428 --> 12:44.055
How can... that be?

12:45.965 --> 12:47.125
How?

13:01.614 --> 13:05.243
I'm a Master Warrior
from the Company...

13:05.317 --> 13:08.252
...that wants to destroy
the surface world you live in.

13:09.188 --> 13:10.655
I'm your enemy.

13:11.757 --> 13:13.349
Why are you doing this?

13:13.459 --> 13:15.290
I don't know.

13:15.895 --> 13:18.728
I know that this is the guy
who kidnapped Ruri.

13:18.798 --> 13:20.231
The one that made her cry.

13:20.933 --> 13:21.524
But...!

13:22.802 --> 13:23.325
But?

13:24.003 --> 13:28.030
This isn't the time to be quibbling
about whether we're enemies!

13:28.574 --> 13:31.441
I wouldn't feel good about myself
if I let you die!

13:37.550 --> 13:38.539
What?

13:38.651 --> 13:40.949
I know that it sounds strange,
but...

13:42.521 --> 13:43.545
Yeah. Wow.

13:43.722 --> 13:46.054
You must be a pretty happy guy.

13:46.458 --> 13:49.393
Carrying on as the
happy-go-lucky guy that you are.

13:49.461 --> 13:50.689
Don't give me that crap!

13:51.063 --> 13:52.121
Let me tell you something.

13:52.198 --> 13:55.634
The reason why the Company
hates the surface people.

13:56.969 --> 13:59.938
Long ago,
deep under the city of Tokyo...

14:00.005 --> 14:03.031
...there was a scientific research
facility called "Hakoniwa"...

14:03.108 --> 14:06.475
...its mission was to draw
out unknown genetic abilities.

14:06.545 --> 14:08.445
The special powers that we have.

14:09.148 --> 14:13.278
In order to get good empirical
data, the scientists gathered...

14:13.352 --> 14:16.048
...children from all over the world.

14:18.524 --> 14:19.821
A small town...

14:20.359 --> 14:22.384
A small town with beautiful snow.

14:24.029 --> 14:28.693
I was born into a household that
was very poor, even for that town.

14:29.201 --> 14:32.568
I only remember crying all the time.

14:39.478 --> 14:42.811
They came to that small town.

14:45.217 --> 14:47.913
And no one stopped them.

14:48.220 --> 14:51.018
As though this was a normal occurrence.

14:53.392 --> 14:54.324
Do you understand?

14:54.793 --> 14:56.556
I was abandoned.

14:57.029 --> 14:58.690
Even by my own parents.

15:00.065 --> 15:01.225
Everyone was.

15:02.268 --> 15:03.257
Even Chelsea...

15:04.737 --> 15:05.465
And Seki...

15:06.338 --> 15:09.000
Everyone who lives
in the Underground...

15:09.074 --> 15:11.508
...was denied basic human dignity.

15:11.710 --> 15:14.110
And when the scientists realized
the danger of the powers...

15:14.179 --> 15:17.148
...they sealed off the Hakoniwa
and disappeared.

15:19.118 --> 15:21.848
We had nowhere to go home to.

15:22.688 --> 15:24.553
So with Kashin as our leader...

15:24.623 --> 15:26.750
...the people left behind
made a decision.

15:27.259 --> 15:27.918
Kashin?

15:28.827 --> 15:31.853
To use the Dragons, the most
powerful creation of the scientists...

15:31.931 --> 15:34.024
...to destroy the surface world.

15:35.935 --> 15:38.028
That was the beginning
of everything.

15:38.837 --> 15:41.829
However, as time passed...

15:41.907 --> 15:44.501
...I didn't really care
about that anymore.

15:45.277 --> 15:47.370
I didn't care who the enemy was.

15:47.513 --> 15:51.074
As long as I was fighting,
I could forget all of my miseries.

15:51.717 --> 15:53.708
And that's when you appeared.

15:54.720 --> 15:56.449
It was a lot of fun.

15:56.522 --> 15:58.183
Even having you wound me.

15:58.524 --> 16:00.492
I didn't care about that either.

16:01.794 --> 16:02.726
Rat-Tail...

16:04.296 --> 16:05.422
Don't misunderstand!

16:11.370 --> 16:13.361
I'm not going to die so easily!

16:13.672 --> 16:15.697
I wouldn't want to die a loser!

16:16.709 --> 16:18.199
Rat-Tail!

16:38.797 --> 16:40.025
Rumina!

16:41.467 --> 16:44.163
Rumina! Are you okay?

16:51.043 --> 16:54.103
Hey, can't you get up there,
Ginnosuke?!

16:54.446 --> 16:57.244
J-Just a little more.

16:59.118 --> 17:00.745
Uh, there. I've got it.

17:02.287 --> 17:03.618
Can you get up there?

17:04.056 --> 17:05.421
Hang on.

17:12.798 --> 17:14.595
H-Hey! Ginnosuke!

17:14.700 --> 17:16.565
What did you see?! Ginnosuke!

17:17.803 --> 17:19.361
Well, that's just pathetic.

17:19.438 --> 17:20.666
You sure you can't walk?

17:21.140 --> 17:22.767
I won my fight, okay!

17:22.841 --> 17:24.706
I'm wounded, you know!

17:26.612 --> 17:27.510
Quiet.

17:27.746 --> 17:29.475
We don't want her to wake up.

17:35.254 --> 17:36.881
Come on, Ginnosuke...

17:39.658 --> 17:42.889
You can't even carry a girl
on your back?!

17:43.262 --> 17:44.695
And you call yourself a man?!

17:44.763 --> 17:47.288
I'm more the intellectual type.

17:48.967 --> 17:51.629
We should've done this
in the first place.

17:52.171 --> 17:54.969
You get good marks
for physical endurance...

17:55.040 --> 17:56.940
...but you score low on comfort.

17:57.009 --> 18:00.445
Look, I was just fighting
that Rat-Tail.

18:00.512 --> 18:02.036
I'm pretty tired myself.

18:02.781 --> 18:04.544
Why are you blushing?

18:04.716 --> 18:05.444
Who's blushing?!

18:07.619 --> 18:10.486
Come to think of it,
your dream back in junior high...

18:10.556 --> 18:13.047
...was to hold a girl's hand, right?

18:13.225 --> 18:16.592
Shut up! It's not like it was just
any girl, you know!

18:16.762 --> 18:19.663
Who'd want to hold hands with her?!

18:20.732 --> 18:21.960
Hey, what's the matter?

18:22.801 --> 18:23.859
I'm sleepy.

18:24.036 --> 18:26.334
Sleepy?! Hang on a minute!

18:26.672 --> 18:29.163
What're we supposed to do
if you fall asleep?!

18:29.908 --> 18:34.072
Maybe it's because
I used my power too much.

18:34.513 --> 18:36.208
But that can't be all.

18:36.515 --> 18:38.949
I feel something from the past.

18:39.251 --> 18:40.650
How far back?

18:41.587 --> 18:43.487
Memories from my childhood...

18:44.389 --> 18:46.152
I can't remember them too well.

18:54.933 --> 18:55.922
She's asleep.

18:56.802 --> 18:59.999
Hey, wake up! Blondie!

19:00.072 --> 19:01.006
- Hey! Wake up!

19:01.006 --> 19:03.440
- Hey! Wake up!
- You've got to stay quiet!

19:03.742 --> 19:04.309
- Blondie!

19:04.309 --> 19:05.333
- Blondie!
- Be quiet!

19:15.020 --> 19:17.045
Salute to Lord Kashin!

19:26.431 --> 19:27.329
I see.

19:27.399 --> 19:29.629
Lord Kashin is coming today.

19:33.071 --> 19:35.198
I pray that everyone's okay.

19:38.076 --> 19:39.441
My Maiden...

20:01.099 --> 20:01.963
It's Lord Kashin...

20:02.034 --> 20:03.558
It's Lord Kashin!

20:06.004 --> 20:08.973
The cave of the Dragons
has been located.

20:09.641 --> 20:13.771
The time for judgment against
the surface dwellers is near.

20:15.847 --> 20:19.305
To the filthy surface world...

20:19.885 --> 20:22.217
...we will bring a new beginning
by destruction!

20:45.544 --> 20:50.379
Again, I walk the streets today

20:50.449 --> 20:56.581
As if I have a purpose

20:56.655 --> 21:08.795
Through a city that looks
polished beyond belief

21:09.601 --> 21:20.478
Are you crying?
Those of you with such tiny pasts

21:20.545 --> 21:32.047
When you look up,
you see the sky on a digital screen

21:32.891 --> 21:41.731
The song of the wind...
I climb up the long staircase

21:41.800 --> 21:45.531
I tried to listen

21:45.604 --> 21:53.670
Hold me
The dream that gently wounded me

21:53.745 --> 22:02.983
Has faded away
Please don't cry

22:11.430 --> 22:13.330
Preview

22:13.732 --> 22:17.327
Rumina, Chelsea, Ginnosuke...

22:17.536 --> 22:20.471
I want to meet the people
I care for once again.

22:21.540 --> 22:23.633
The beautiful full moon,
the flower garden...

22:23.709 --> 22:25.142
...the refreshing wind...

22:25.877 --> 22:28.778
Shiel, would you like to come as well?

22:29.381 --> 22:29.870
What?

22:30.349 --> 22:32.681
You're going to grant me
my wishes?

22:33.518 --> 22:36.180
Next time on
Tokyo Underground...

22:36.254 --> 22:36.655
..."The Insubordination -
Escape into the Light".

22:36.655 --> 22:38.557
The Insubordination -
Escape into the Light
..."The Insubordination -
Escape into the Light".

22:38.557 --> 22:41.287
The Insubordination -
Escape into the Light
